description:
Located just 3 minutes from the public transport station "Sendlinger Tor" and only a 5-minute walk into the Fußgängerzone, this freshly renovated apartment welcomes you with comfort, style, and thoughtful details. Situated in the famous Glockenbachviertel, one of Munich’s most desirable neighborhoods, you will enjoy a calm and quiet residential atmosphere while still being just steps away from some of the city’s best restaurants, bars, and clubs. It offers the perfect balance between peaceful living and vibrant urban life.

The fully renovated apartment includes:
*a beautifully designed living and sleeping area with soft lighting, a comfortable bed, and inviting textiles that create a warm and relaxing atmosphere;
* a brand-new kitchen fully equipped with a modern black sink, an induction cooktop, integrated lighting, and a Panasonic microwave — perfect for preparing and enjoying meals at home;
* kitchen essentials such as plates, glasses, cups, cutlery, and cooking utensils, all provided for your comfort and convenience;
* a newly renovated bathroom featuring clean, light tiles, an illuminated mirror, and a luxurious rainshower;
* a washing machine discreetly fitted into the bathroom for your convenience;

The apartment also includes amenities such as:
- a coffee machine,
- a kettle for tea lovers,
- an iron and ironing board,
- a drying rack.

A broadcasting tax of 18€ per month must be paid separately in Germany. You will receive a letter about this after move-in; the fee is not included in the rent.

The apartment is professionally cleaned at the end of each stay.

I hope you enjoy this apartment as much as we do! :)

Please note: There are several apartments with the same layout. To get an accurate impression of this specific unit, we highly recommend watching the video, as it provides the most authentic and detailed view of the apartment.

