Located near Sendlinger Tor and on the 6th floor of a lifestyle hotel, with a view over the city to the alps, you will be seduced by this comfortable and cozy two-room apartment and the quality of its equipment. 

For a business trip, a family trip, or even a friend's trip, you will be delighted to find yourself in the very trendy Glockenbach neighborhood. You will enjoy the many restaurants and bars or a stroll at the Viktualien Market in this area.

 The apartment includes :
- a nice living room to entertain yourself or enjoy company;
- one bedroom;
- a fully equipped kitchen where you can cook and share delicious meals;
- a bathroom;
- two large built-in closets;
-two balconies

It also includes amenities such as :
- an air conditioning system
- a coffee machine
- a kettle for your teas,
- an iron and ironing board;
- a washing machine and a drying rack.

A broadcasting-tax of 18€ per month needs to be paid separately in Germany. The tenant will be informed by the receipient via letter after the move-in. The fee is not included in the rent.

The apartment is cleaned by a professional at the end of each stay.

I hope you enjoy this apartment as much as we do! :)
